		},
		{
			"height":1360,
			"id":"ca95be450e6f2f3f",
			"label":"The Shield",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"group",
			"width":280,
			"x":3480,
			"y":1780
		},
		{
			"color":"#7f7676",
			"height":1080,
			"id":"db8e0ec6cabc510d",
			"label":"Shield Types",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"group",
			"width":300,
			"x":760,
			"y":1800
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"0d99ce083861ec4f",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"#### System as Seen Last Talked on",
			"type":"text",
			"width":420,
			"x":1140,
			"y":1972
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"e77804f6a3c90f6f",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"AC for having Shield on your person",
			"type":"text",
			"width":230,
			"x":1120,
			"y":2100
		},
		{
			"file":"9-Old Ideas/1-Game Rules/Combat/Gear/Armor/Shield Ideas/Round Shield.md",
			"height":230,
			"id":"bbd2927152e07458",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"file",
			"width":260,
			"x":780,
			"y":2100
		},
		{
			"height":485,
			"id":"54812887f8882b9a",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Armor having resistances at base is main non shield through point the only way to work around this without messing with shields is intern armor.\n\nWhile these Res values have become a differentiator for some armor types armor has more than just AC as another value to mess with. Removing it as a property of armor and forcing bases to instead lean into other properties to be different. \n\nExpanding some armor types to not be bases but improvements of a base can also further help maintain why you would some types over others while allowing shields to be source for damage res without materials. (EX is making all other leather types not bases but improvements or modifications of the leather base)",
			"type":"text",
			"width":440,
			"x":1675,
			"y":2495
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"88b5b4376518892f",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"AC for Holding Shield Ready to use",
			"type":"text",
			"width":220,
			"x":1360,
			"y":2100
		},
		{
			"height":85,
			"id":"3ce9b543b7c41b98",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"The flat damage res to all types while no longer invalidating dice on a roll still invalidate damage from them when stacked with armor",
			"type":"text",
			"width":440,
			"x":1645,
			"y":2308
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"750aee4ba95a6726",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Makes Shield a Dynamic piece of kit with many Tunable parts",
			"type":"text",
			"width":440,
			"x":1140,
			"y":2308
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"1f6ca98d9c4460cb",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"### Issues",
			"type":"text",
			"width":140,
			"x":1780,
			"y":2233
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"e38358e80f108e67",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Resistances for any Hit having hit your Shield",
			"type":"text",
			"width":220,
			"x":1360,
			"y":2173
		},
		{
			"height":90,
			"id":"207495e166aa1839",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Makes Defensive build more than buff and gear stacking as it has to play the AP game for full power",
			"type":"text",
			"width":440,
			"x":1140,
			"y":2380
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"98ead6ef6f12d2ee",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"#### Non Shield Solution",
			"type":"text",
			"width":290,
			"x":1720,
			"y":2435
		},
		{
			"height":484,
			"id":"69ba451a06f666cf",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## >< Mirror Shield\n\nHalf the Targeted Spells Mana\n\nWhen a Spell attack Critically fails against your AC you may spend the required Mana to Reflect the Spell back at the caster. Performing a Spell attack using your Stats against the Caster. Gain all Spell effects based on your result.\n\n#### Training Requirements\n At least 1 Training for a Spell\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":339,
			"x":4220,
			"y":1908
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"4fbd8d50e9adbbc3",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"#### Resistanceless System",
			"type":"text",
			"width":290,
			"x":1675,
			"y":1972
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"874a2756100894d4",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Passive",
			"type":"text",
			"width":140,
			"x":1680,
			"y":2036
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"4019dcf24df44377",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Passive",
			"type":"text",
			"width":140,
			"x":1165,
			"y":2040
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"e3e4e343f62a4aec",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Active",
			"type":"text",
			"width":120,
			"x":1930,
			"y":2036
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"9bf7036f4a266d92",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Active",
			"type":"text",
			"width":120,
			"x":1415,
			"y":2040
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"b6a1c874e23a65b8",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"### Pros",
			"type":"text",
			"width":140,
			"x":1290,
			"y":2248
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"6147d51038d5b22f",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"### Issues",
			"type":"text",
			"width":140,
			"x":1290,
			"y":2475
		},
		{
			"height":85,
			"id":"a1d13ec01099eaa5",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Resistance stacking making Lower dice do nothing even with basic combos like chain and Kite having a res of 4s,3p,2b",
			"type":"text",
			"width":440,
			"x":1140,
			"y":2535
		},
		{
			"height":85,
			"id":"dd4569aba7503fab",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Non passive shields (Buckler) Only Suffer under this system as they become a AP Drain to ever have value",
			"type":"text",
			"width":440,
			"x":1140,
			"y":2650
		},
		{
			"height":364,
			"id":"1f2a58cb0a4ed231",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## >< Shield Block\n\nWhen a Strike is Declared against you before it is rolled you can raise your shield as long as it it isn't currently raised and gain its AC for the Declared Strike only.\n#### Training Requirements\n None",
			"type":"text",
			"width":319,
			"x":4589,
			"y":1908
		},
		{
			"height":265,
			"id":"1ae9401ed404c080",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Shielded Pin\n\nWhen you have Pinned or Grappled a Creature your Size or smaller successfully while a Shield is Equipped. The Creature can not make Strikes while Pinned and you gain a +2 on Challenges to keep them pinned.",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":2620,
			"y":2060
		},
		{
			"height":364,
			"id":"c0a64f2d85bcefb3",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## >< Reflexive Guard\n\nWhen a you must perform a **DEX** or **Acrobatics** roll against Strike you gain add your shields AC (Protection?) to the roll.\n#### Training Requirements\n None",
			"type":"text",
			"width":319,
			"x":4230,
			"y":2418
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"d2de2dd136620061",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"#### Lone Universal Action",
			"type":"text",
			"width":260,
			"x":3883,
			"y":2651
		},
		{
			"height":389,
			"id":"2d2858734f08f819",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## >< Shield Block V2\n\nWhen a Strike would deal Physical Damage to you and your shield is raised. You can react using your Shield to better Ward off the hit. Use your shields AC value as Extra Protection for that hit. \n#### Training Requirements\n None",
			"type":"text",
			"width":319,
			"x":4589,
			"y":2292
		},
		{
			"height":431,
			"id":"8e8cf674249d9d0a",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## <> Shield Bash\n Flourish\n \n Make a Strength Challenge against an Engaged target. \n On Critical Failure: User becomes Off Guard On Success: Deal **1+str** Bludgeoning damage and make the target **Off Guard**. \n On ***Critical Success***: Deal ***1+str*** Bludgeoning damage and make the target and the Target becomes ***Stunned 1***.\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":273,
			"x":2244,
			"y":2290
		},
		{
			"file":"9-Old Ideas/1-Game Rules/Combat/Gear/Armor/Shield Ideas/Kite Shield.md",
			"height":230,
			"id":"9039e44e12652d1a",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"file",
			"width":260,
			"x":780,
			"y":2360
		},
		{
			"file":"9-Old Ideas/1-Game Rules/Combat/Gear/Armor/Shield Ideas/Round Shield Post Talk.md",
			"height":300,
			"id":"48085ed4cd6ef47a",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"file",
			"width":240,
			"x":3500,
			"y":2150
		},
		{
			"height":190,
			"id":"5fcd49fc413538c8",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## <> Shield Raise \nGain a Shields Raised AC and Resistances until start of your next turn",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":2557,
			"y":2380
		},
		{
			"file":"9-Old Ideas/1-Game Rules/Combat/Gear/Armor/Shield Ideas/Kite Shield Post Talk.md",
			"height":300,
			"id":"d5c521c25f42bbfd",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"file",
			"width":240,
			"x":3500,
			"y":2480
		},
		{
			"file":"9-Old Ideas/1-Game Rules/Combat/Gear/Armor/Shield Ideas/Tower Shield.md",
			"height":230,
			"id":"1e61c9386ac1c273",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"file",
			"width":260,
			"x":780,
			"y":2620
		},
		{
			"height":260,
			"id":"0adfc67d1a37f17d",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Disarming Block\n\nOnce per round when a Target fails to land a strike you may attempt to [Disarm](https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2383) the creature even if you do not have a free hand.\n\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":2600,
			"y":2590
		},
		{
			"height":520,
			"id":"a85583062ee3ebe7",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## <> Shield Strike\n\nVersatile *(can be two handed we need to work out these words)*\n \nMake a strike against a Target that deals your Shields **AC + STR** as Blunt Damage. If you use 2 hands for this strike you can use double your shields Passive AC.\n\n #### Training Requirements\n None",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":5313,
			"y":1930
		},
		{
			"color":"#70724f",
			"height":100,
			"id":"8d0cad80c51744ca",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"pill","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Might be a little weird with current V2 but worth thinking over",
			"type":"text",
			"width":220,
			"x":5753,
			"y":2960
		},
		{
			"height":417,
			"id":"bf91dae7ba9bd5e3",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Shielded Pin\n\nWhen you have Pinned or Grappled a Creature your Size or smaller successfully while a Shield is Equipped. The Creature can not make Strikes while Pinned and you gain a +2 on Challenges to keep them pinned.\n\n #### Training Requirements\n None",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":5713,
			"y":1974
		},
		{
			"color":"#c7cb90",
			"height":142,
			"id":"54b5d5cf80225509",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"pill","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Protection can be locked to Physical only curently isent purely for testing and allowing for some base elemental help on characters.",
			"type":"text",
			"width":347,
			"x":3840,
			"y":2340
		},
		{
			"height":220,
			"id":"07e95783e43394a3",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## <> Raise Shield \nGain a Shields AC until start of your next turn. You can not perform any strikes after using this action during a turn.",
			"type":"text",
			"width":280,
			"x":3873,
			"y":2739
		},
		{
			"height":585,
			"id":"c9c89a415f0bed23",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## <> Shield Bash\n Flourish\n \n Make a Strength Challenge against an Engaged target. \n On Critical Failure: User becomes Off Guard On Success: Deal **1+str** Bludgeoning damage and make the target **Off Guard**. \n On ***Critical Success***: Deal ***1+str*** Bludgeoning damage and make the target and the Target becomes ***Stunned 1***.\n \n #### Training Requirements\n None",
			"type":"text",
			"width":273,
			"x":5020,
			"y":1930
		},
		{
			"height":440,
			"id":"9b4ce1565a75daa4",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Quick Block\n\nAt the start of each of your turns you gain an extra Reaction that can only be spent on Shield Block.\n\n #### Training Requirements\n Require Shield Block\n Require 1 other Shield Training\n Require Level ?? (? is stand in as need to talk about leveling rate)",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":5773,
			"y":2431
		},
		{
			"height":417,
			"id":"6034c9f12d0b371e",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Disarming Block\n\nOnce per round when a Target fails to land a strike you may attempt to [Disarm](https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2383) the creature even if you do not have a free hand.\n\n #### Training Requirements\n At least 2 other Shield Trainings\n Possible Level Requirement\n\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":320,
			"x":6033,
			"y":1974
		},
		{
			"height":440,
			"id":"718ecc2c2b2ac25e",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Guarding Warden\n\nYou may use Shield Block when an ally in 5ft of you is target for an attack. That ally receives all bonuses instead of you fallowing all other rules of the action. \n\n #### Training Requirements\n**Leadership** or **CHA** of at least 5",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":6093,
			"y":2431
		},
		{
			"color":"#707257",
			"height":140,
			"id":"45c700fca6ebff5e",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"pill","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Might want to inculde or make a Mirror Shield Version",
			"type":"text",
			"width":197,
			"x":6243,
			"y":2960
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"8a85d97f47706cd7",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Like DND all AC is Passive",
			"type":"text",
			"width":230,
			"x":1635,
			"y":2096
		},
		{
			"height":124,
			"id":"5bfc23f8d092c0ad",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Raising offers a flat Damage Res and possible advantage challenge roll types",
			"type":"text",
			"width":220,
			"x":1875,
			"y":2096
		},
