			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":"invisible",
				"shape":null,
				"textAlign":"center"
			},
			"text":"# A Tool of Defense in Both Form and Function",
			"type":"text",
			"width":680,
			"x":1480,
			"y":1720
		},
		{
			"height":110,
			"id":"159376c510054840",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"# Useful PF2e Reference\nhttps://2e.aonprd.com/Archetypes.aspx?ID=240",
			"type":"text",
			"width":480,
			"x":2380,
			"y":1730
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"d47af6a2afb0abfe",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"### Protection vs AC",
			"type":"text",
			"width":260,
			"x":3840,
			"y":1762
		},
		{
			"file":"9-Old Ideas/1-Game Rules/Combat/Gear/Armor/Shield Ideas/Buckler Post Talk.md",
			"height":300,
			"id":"2a595ef0ef5b1d65",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"file",
			"width":240,
			"x":3500,
			"y":1820
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"52f3e832184409db",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"#### Reactive Shield Actions",
			"type":"text",
			"width":260,
			"x":4459,
			"y":1832
		},
		{
			"height":440,
			"id":"190883a58ef61dc3",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"Protection is a always active resistances that applies to all damage you take while your shield is equipped. \n\nThis represents the obstacle and defensives a shield offers even when not actively hidden behind.\n\nInstead the AC of the Shield is now only gained on when the action to Raise a Shield is taken. This represents the fighter actively using the shield to avoid any hits from happening at all",
			"type":"text",
			"width":340,
			"x":3800,
			"y":1822
		},
		{
			"file":"9-Old Ideas/1-Game Rules/Combat/Gear/Armor/Shield Ideas/Buckler.md",
			"height":230,
			"id":"004f9e38f60bfbcc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"type":"file",
			"width":260,
			"x":780,
			"y":1840
		},
		{
			"height":192,
			"id":"831d4934e550a32d",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## >< Shield Block\n\nWhen a Strike lands on you and Your Shield is not Raised you can snap it into position gaining its resistances for the hit.",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":2600,
			"y":1840
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"40da67f49a7fe112",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"#### Shield Strikes",
			"type":"text",
			"width":260,
			"x":5163,
			"y":1845
		},
		{
			"color":"#74765a",
			"height":470,
			"id":"eefb0c8dcd6f6923",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"pill","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"Nimble\nThe Item does not prevent the wielder from manipulating or Interacting using the hand holding it. This does not allow for the use or wielding of a weapon.\n(Possible prevent strikes from the item on a turn the hand is used this way)",
			"type":"text",
			"width":180,
			"x":3200,
			"y":1855
		},
		{
			"height":60,
			"id":"e721513eeb927700",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"#### Shield Passives",
			"type":"text",
			"width":260,
			"x":5883,
			"y":1861
		},
		{
			"height":75,
			"id":"72c6d5fb641a6237",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Defense in 2 Ways",
			"type":"text",
			"width":320,
			"x":1400,
			"y":1861
		},
		{
			"height":361,
			"id":"0ae47cf151e91ccb",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"predefined-process","textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## <> Shield Strike\n\nVersatile *(can be two handed we need to work out these words)*\n \nMake a strike against a Target that deals your Shields **AC + STR** as Blunt Damage. If you use 2 hands for this strike you can use double your shields Passive AC.",
			"type":"text",
			"width":300,
			"x":2257,
			"y":1872
		},
